# Type scale

Two sans families: **Mona Sans** (`font-heading`) for titles, **Schibsted Grotesk** (`font-sans`) for everything else. The site wordmark is the lockup image (`site-wordmark`), not typeset Grotesk or Mona. Ticket census figures use **Barlow Condensed ExtraBold** (`type-census`). Do not put Mona on body copy, kickers, posts, empty states, or the site name. Do not use a coding mono for numbers.

| Role | Face | Size | Example |
| --- | --- | --- | --- |
| Wordmark | Lockup image | `site-wordmark` | MarketRegular |
| Kicker | Grotesk | `type-kicker` (`text-sm`) | Toronto, Live posts, When, where, or what |
| Page title | Mona | `h1` (`text-3xl sm:text-4xl leading-tight`) | Toronto farmers' markets |
| Panel / section | Mona | `h2` (`text-2xl leading-tight`) | Find a market |
| Narrow column / day / card | Mona | `h3` or `type-column` (`text-lg leading-tight`) | The group chat from the stalls |
| Lede | Grotesk | `type-lede` (`text-lg`) | Sentence under an h1 |
| How / body | Grotesk | `text-base` | Choose when, a neighbourhood… |
| List names | Grotesk | `text-base font-medium` | Wychwood Barns in a row |
| Times / prices / stalls | Mona semibold, condensed | `type-nums` | `8 AM–2 PM` |
| Ticket census | Barlow Condensed ExtraBold | `type-census` | `39`, `635`, `1,976` |

Use real heading tags and let the base sizes apply. Do not add `text-4xl`, `text-5xl`, `text-[13px]`, or `font-heading` on paragraphs. Small figures use `type-nums`, not `font-mono`. Directory counts on the ticket use `type-census`.

The wordmark is the lockup image, not a page title. Nav stays Grotesk `text-sm font-medium`.
